<title>PHILIPPINES: RFM to start 2.5 bln-peso property project.</title>
<headline>RFM to start 2.5 bln-peso property project.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>RFM Properties &amp; Holdings Inc, a unit of diversified food and beverage company RFM Corp, said on Friday it will start construction of its 2.5 billion-peso residential condominium project early next year.</p>
<p>Called the Citadina, this would be the second condominium project of RFM Properties.</p>
<p>The project, which is located in suburban Quezon city, is expected to be completed in three years' time, the company said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
